{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39768","headline":"襄州试白云归帝乡 · 黄滔","name":"襄州试白云归帝乡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳杳复霏霏，应缘有所依。\n不言天路远，终望帝乡归。\n高岳和霜过，遥关带月飞。\n渐怜双阙近，宁恨衆山违。\n阵触银河乱，光连粉署微。\n旅人随计日，自笑比麻衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}